    ['type' => 'p', 'html' => 'Every growing business eventually faces a common challenge: managing daily operations becomes more complicated as customers, employees, and workloads increase. Tasks that were once easy to handle through spreadsheets, emails, and manual records can start consuming valuable time.'],
