    ['type' => 'p', 'html' => 'A connected system can also make it easier for management to monitor business performance without collecting reports manually from different teams. Read our <a href="business-system-integration-guide">guide to connecting business systems without replacing existing software</a> for practical steps.'],

    ['type' => 'h2', 'text' => '5. Prioritize Security and Data Protection'],
    ['type' => 'p', 'html' => 'Business software may contain customer information, financial records, employee details, and confidential company data. Security should therefore be a key selection criterion.'],
