    ['type' => 'p', 'html' => 'Businesses should also determine where their data is stored, who can access it, and how it can be recovered if a system fails.'],
    ['type' => 'p', 'html' => 'If the software handles sensitive information or operates in a regulated industry, review the relevant legal and contractual requirements before implementation.'],
    ['type' => 'p', 'html' => 'A solution that improves productivity but exposes important business information can create far greater costs than the problems it was intended to solve. Our <a href="cyber-security">cyber security services</a> help businesses protect their applications and data.'],

